  [adv_void_gift]="$ICON $VOID A touch of cold silver is allowed. Subject: a pair of dark hands cupping a small bright violet star."
  [adv_void_first_choice]="$ICON $VOID A touch of cold silver is allowed. Subject: a starry path forking in two, a small glowing violet rift at the end of each branch."
  [adv_void_cross]="$ICON $VOID A touch of cold silver is allowed. Subject: two beams of violet light crossing in an X, a bright white star where they meet."
  [adv_void_first_awakening]="$ICON $VOID A touch of cold silver is allowed. Subject: a single wide-open violet eye inside a rift, white stars around it like lashes."
  [adv_void_mastery]="$ICON $VOID A touch of cold silver is allowed. Subject: a silver laurel wreath around three small glowing violet gems."
  [adv_void_double]="$ICON $VOID A touch of cold silver is allowed. Subject: two glowing violet rifts side by side under one small silver crown."
  [adv_void_peak]="$ICON $VOID A touch of cold silver is allowed. Subject: a dark floating mountain peak in space with a bright silver-white star above it."
  [adv_myc_root]="$ICON $MYC Subject: an old open book with a glowing teal mushroom growing out of its pages."
  [adv_myc_gift]="$ICON $MYC Subject: a tiny glowing green sprout with two leaves rising from a glowing spore."
  [adv_myc_first_choice]="$ICON $MYC Subject: one root splitting into two glowing branches, a small mushroom at the end of each, one teal and one green."
  [adv_myc_cross]="$ICON $MYC Subject: two glowing fungal threads, one green and one teal, crossing in an X with a bright spore where they meet."
  [adv_myc_first_awakening]="$ICON $MYC Subject: a mushroom with a glowing teal eye opening on its cap."
  [adv_myc_mastery]="$ICON $MYC Subject: a fairy ring of small glowing mushrooms around a bright teal gem."
  [adv_myc_double]="$ICON $MYC Subject: two glowing mushrooms side by side under one small golden crown."
  [adv_myc_peak]="$ICON $MYC Subject: a giant ancient glowing mushroom towering over tiny ones, a bright teal star above it."
  [adv_root]="$ICON $GEN Subject: an open ancient spellbook with a glowing golden rune rising from its pages."
  [adv_gift]="$ICON $GEN Subject: a bright glowing golden seed sprouting two small green leaves and a white spark of light."
  [adv_first_choice]="$ICON $GEN Subject: a fork in a path with two signposts, one glowing green, one glowing violet."
  [adv_cross]="$ICON $GEN Subject: two glowing paths, one green and one violet, crossing in an X with a gold star at the centre."
  [adv_first_awakening]="$ICON $GEN Subject: a single eye opening wide, golden rays bursting around it."
  [adv_mastery]="$ICON $GEN Subject: a golden laurel wreath around three small glowing gems, green, violet and gold."
  [adv_double]="$ICON $GEN Subject: two small crowns side by side, one glowing violet, one glowing green."
  [adv_peak]="$ICON $GEN Subject: a snowy white mountain peak under a large bright golden star."
  [adv_void_pocket]="$ICON $VOID Subject: a small floating stone island with a tiny house, floating in starry darkness."
  [adv_void_pocket_big]="$ICON $VOID Subject: a large floating island with a house and a small tree, a glowing violet rim around it."
  [adv_void_walls]="$ICON $VOID Subject: a bold violet dashed arrow passing straight through a grey brick wall."
